---
# Source of the where-deposits-go diagram on /changelog (the Vault pages entry).
# Baked in twice as inline SVG: this source (LR) above 760px, and below it
# deposits-narrow.mmd, one column with the four vaults in one box, since four
# boxes side by side do not read at phone width. Render with Mermaid 11 in a
# page that has Space Grotesk loaded, so the boxes are sized to the site's font.
config:
  theme: base
  htmlLabels: false
  fontFamily: "'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif"
  flowchart:
    curve: linear
    padding: 16
    nodeSpacing: 24
    rankSpacing: 40
    diagramPadding: 2
  themeVariables:
    darkMode: true
    background: transparent
    fontFamily: "'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif"
    fontSize: 15px
    primaryColor: "#06080c"
    primaryTextColor: "#f2f4f9"
    primaryBorderColor: "#2e3a4e"
    nodeBorder: "#2e3a4e"
    mainBkg: "#06080c"
    lineColor: "#00e5ff"
    textColor: "#c2c9d8"
---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: Where a deposit goes
  accDescr: A USDC deposit goes to the router, which splits it across the four sleeve vaults by the weights in force: Fixed Income, Small Cap Tokens, Protocol Tokens and Real World Assets. Each vault's page and the allocation page show what it holds.
  deposit["A USDC deposit"] --> router["The router splits it by<br/>the weights in force"]
  router --> usdc["Fixed Income<br/>rmUSDC"]
  router --> agent["Small Cap Tokens<br/>rmAGENT"]
  router --> proto["Protocol Tokens<br/>rmPROTO"]
  router --> rwa["Real World Assets<br/>rmRWA"]
  usdc --> shown["Each vault's page and the<br/>allocation page show it"]
  agent --> shown
  proto --> shown
  rwa --> shown
  linkStyle default stroke-width:1.5px
